 summary:["RA: symmetric polyarthritis MCP/PIP/wrist (ไม่เป็น DIP), morning stiffness >1 ชม., ร่วม constitutional symptoms","X-ray RA: periarticular soft-tissue swelling, periarticular osteopenia, marginal erosions (pannus) without bone proliferation, uniform/concentric JSN, volar subluxation","X-ray OA: asymmetric, DIP/PIP/1st CMC, eccentric JSN, subchondral sclerosis/cyst, marginal osteophytes (Heberden = DIP, Bouchard = PIP)","2010 ACR/EULAR: joints + RF/anti-CCP + ESR/CRP + duration ≥6 wk รวม ≥6/10","Tx: methotrexate ± bridging steroid, treat-to-target"],
